@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Protected Recipient Viewing
start
:Open protected share entry;
:Establish required link-scoped viewer context;
:Resolve current link, selected content, language and eligibility;
if (Current access permitted?) then (yes)
 :Show selected professional presentation;
 if (Request eligible file / PDF?) then (yes)
  :Recheck current policy and exact artifact availability;
  if (Delivery allowed and material usable?) then (yes)
   :Deliver only authorized selected bytes;
  else (no)
   :Show safe denied / unavailable state;
  endif
 else (no)
  :Continue within permitted presentation;
 endif
else (no)
 :Show safe invalid / disabled / denied feedback;
 :Offer only the permitted next step;
endif
:Do not expose owner workspace or substitute unrelated content;
stop
@enduml
